{"id": "09974127-091d-45b4-8a95-7e2cd47b2297", "slug": "aureo-intelligence-is-our-medium", "title": "AUREO | Intelligence is our Medium", "description": "Aureo Intelligence Sidebar Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"AUREO | Intelligence is our Medium\"\ndescription: \"Aureo Intelligence Sidebar Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#C5A67C\"\n  secondary: \"#050505\"\n  accent: \"#C5A67C\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#EAE4D8\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#7A7A7A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Cormorant Garamond\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"1px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# AUREO | Intelligence is our Medium\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 412; favorites: 10; remixes: 4.\nTags: sidebar, animated, webgl, threejs, bento, dither, navigation, support.\n## Overview\nAureo Intelligence Sidebar Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAUREO STUDIO WORK SERVICES LAB JOURNAL CONTACT GLOBAL STUDIO EST. MMXVIII AI CREATIVITY INTELLIGENCE IS OUR MEDIUM AUREO is a next-generation creative studio where artificial intelligence and human imagination build ico…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: INTELLIGENCE IS OUR MEDIUM; AEON RITUAL.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #C5A67C, secondary #050505, accent #C5A67C, background #050505, surface #EAE4D8, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Cormorant Garamond for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"bg-[#050505] text-[#eae4d8] selection:bg-[#c5a67c]/30 selection:text-white\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>AUREO | Intelligence is our Medium</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Fonts: Cormorant Garamond (Serif) & Inter (Sans) -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300;1,400&family=Inter:wght@200;300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        serif: ['\"Cormorant Garamond\"', 'serif'],\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        brand: {\n                            bg: '#050505',\n                            cream: '#eae4d8',\n                            gold: '#c5a67c',\n                            muted: '#7a7a7a',\n                            dark: '#111111'\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"h-screen w-full overflow-hidden relative font-sans text-brand-cream antialiased font-light\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient WebGL/Canvas Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"ambient-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Background Image & Masking -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 flex justify-end overflow-hidden\">\n        <img\n            src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/5ee0a38a-b5d3-4531-8793-98beed4af162_1600w.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Ambient Architecture\"\n            class=\"gsap-bg-img w-[60%] h-full object-cover object-left opacity-60 mix-blend-luminosity\"\n            style=\"filter: sepia(0.3) hue-rotate(-15deg) contrast(1.1);\"\n        >\n        <!-- The sweeping curve mask covering the left side -->\n        <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none drop-shadow-[20px_0_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n            <path class=\"gsap-curve\" d=\"M0,0 L0,100 L55,100 Q75,50 55,0 Z\" fill=\"#050505\" />\n        </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Layout Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 flex h-full w-full\">\n\n        <!-- Left Sidebar Navigation -->\n        <aside class=\"gsap-sidebar flex flex-col justify-between items-center w-24 h-full border-r border-white/5 py-10 shrink-0\">\n            <!-- Logo area -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-8\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-medium text-brand-cream uppercase rotate-180\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">AUREO</span>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-fall-linear\" class=\"text-brand-gold text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Nav Links -->\n            <nav class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center w-full\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-cream uppercase rotate-180 transition-colors\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">STUDIO</span>\n                    <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[2px] h-4 bg-brand-gold\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center w-full\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-muted group-hover:text-brand-cream transition-colors uppercase rotate-180\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">WORK</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center w-full\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-muted group-hover:text-brand-cream transition-colors uppercase rotate-180\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">SERVICES</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center w-full\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-muted group-hover:text-brand-cream transition-colors uppercase rotate-180\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">LAB</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center w-full\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-muted group-hover:text-brand-cream transition-colors uppercase rotate-180\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">JOURNAL</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center w-full\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-muted group-hover:text-brand-cream transition-colors uppercase rotate-180\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">CONTACT</span>\n                </div>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Info -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-brand-gold rounded-full\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-[0.5rem] tracking-widest text-brand-muted text-center uppercase leading-loose\">\n                    GLOBAL STUDIO<br>EST. MMXVIII\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <!-- Main Content Area -->\n        <section class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center pl-16 md:pl-32 max-w-4xl relative\">\n\n            <!-- Subtitle -->\n            <div class=\"gsap-element flex items-center gap-3 mb-8\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-gold uppercase\">AI</span>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-linear\" class=\"text-brand-muted text-xs\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-gold uppercase\">CREATIVITY</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline -->\n            <h1 class=\"font-serif tracking-tight text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,6rem)] leading-[0.9] text-brand-cream mb-10 select-none\">\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden py-1\"><span class=\"gsap-text inline-block\">INTELLIGENCE</span></div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden py-1\"><span class=\"gsap-text inline-block\">IS OUR</span></div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden py-1\"><span class=\"gsap-text inline-block italic font-light\">MEDIUM</span></div>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Separator -->\n            <div class=\"gsap-element flex items-center gap-4 mb-8 w-64 opacity-50\">\n                <div class=\"h-[1px] flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-muted to-transparent\"></div>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-outline\" class=\"text-brand-gold text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                <div class=\"h-[1px] flex-1 bg-gradient-to-l from-brand-muted to-transparent\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Description -->\n            <p class=\"gsap-element text-sm md:text-base text-brand-muted max-w-sm leading-relaxed mb-12\">\n                AUREO is a next-generation creative studio where artificial intelligence and human imagination build iconic digital experiences.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Actions -->\n            <div class=\"gsap-element flex items-center gap-8\">\n                <!-- Primary Button with Subtle Gradient Border -->\n                <button class=\"relative group overflow-hidden bg-brand-cream text-brand-bg px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.15em] font-medium uppercase relative z-10\">VIEW OUR WORK</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-lg relative z-10 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <!-- Button Glow Effect -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-gold/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 z-0\"></div>\n                </button>\n\n                <button class=\"group flex items-center gap-3 text-brand-muted hover:text-brand-cream transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.15em] font-medium uppercase\">EXPLORE STUDIO</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-lg transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Stats Row -->\n            <div class=\"gsap-element absolute bottom-12 left-16 md:left-32 flex items-end gap-16 border-t border-white/5 pt-8 w-[80%] max-w-lg\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-muted uppercase\">PROJECTS</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"font-serif text-4xl text-brand-gold\">128</span>\n                        <span class=\"font-serif text-xl text-brand-gold\">+</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-[1px] bg-brand-muted mt-2\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-muted uppercase\">GLOBAL CLIENTS</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"font-serif text-4xl text-brand-gold\">64</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-[1px] bg-brand-muted mt-2\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-muted uppercase\">AWARDS</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"font-serif text-4xl text-brand-gold\">27</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-4 h-[1px] bg-brand-muted mt-2\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Right Side Pagination Indicators -->\n        <div class=\"gsap-pagination absolute right-8 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col gap-6 items-center z-20\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-brand-gold font-sans tracking-widest\">01</span>\n                <div class=\"w-4 h-[1px] bg-brand-gold\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 group cursor-pointer\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-fall-linear\" class=\"text-brand-muted text-[0.5rem] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity mb-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-brand-muted font-sans tracking-widest transition-colors group-hover:text-brand-cream\">02</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 group cursor-pointer\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-brand-muted font-sans tracking-widest transition-colors group-hover:text-brand-cream\">03</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 group cursor-pointer\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-brand-muted font-sans tracking-widest transition-colors group-hover:text-brand-cream\">04</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Floating Bottom Right Card (Gradient Border Pattern) -->\n        <div class=\"gsap-card absolute bottom-12 right-24 z-20 p-[1px] rounded-sm group overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-gold/40 via-white/5 to-transparent shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl\">\n            <div class=\"bg-brand-bg/95 w-80 h-full p-6 flex flex-col gap-5 relative z-10\">\n                <!-- Card Header -->\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center w-full\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#c5a67c] shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(197,166,124,0.8)]\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-gold uppercase\">ACTIVE</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-muted uppercase cursor-pointer hover:text-white transition-colors\">VIEW ALL</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card Content -->\n                <div class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                    <img\n                        src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/724142aa-44a6-48d3-9cf3-761e00d05b78_800w.jpg\"\n                        alt=\"Project Thumbnail\"\n                        class=\"w-20 h-16 object-cover rounded-[1px] filter sepia(0.2) contrast(1.1)\"\n                    >\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-sm tracking-wide text-brand-cream font-medium uppercase\">AEON RITUAL</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-brand-muted\">Immersive Experience</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-[0.6rem] text-brand-muted/70 tracking-widest\">AI • 3D • Motion</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Progress Bar -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 w-full mt-2\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[0.6rem] text-brand-muted tracking-widest uppercase\">\n                        <span>PROGRESS</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-brand-cream\">78%</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-white/10 relative\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full bg-brand-gold w-[78%]\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-1 h-1 bg-white rounded-full shadow-[0_0_4px_#fff]\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Subtle hover glow on card -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-gold/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Decorative fine lines -->\n    <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n        <line x1=\"10%\" y1=\"100%\" x2=\"40%\" y2=\"80%\" stroke=\"#c5a67c\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" class=\"gsap-line\" />\n        <line x1=\"60%\" y1=\"100%\" x2=\"80%\" y2=\"60%\" stroke=\"#c5a67c\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" class=\"gsap-line\" />\n    </svg>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- Canvas Ambient Background (Subtle Particles/Noise) ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('ambient-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height;\n        let particles = [];\n\n        function initCanvas() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            particles = [];\n            for (let i = 0; i < 150; i++) {\n                particles.push({\n                    x: Math.random() * width,\n                    y: Math.random() * height,\n                    radius: Math.random() * 1.5,\n                    vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.2,\n                    vy: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.2,\n                    alpha: Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.1\n                });\n            }\n        }\n\n        function animateCanvas() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#c5a67c'; // Gold-ish particles\n\n            particles.forEach(p => {\n                p.x += p.vx;\n                p.y += p.vy;\n\n                if (p.x < 0) p.x = width;\n                if (p.x > width) p.x = 0;\n                if (p.y < 0) p.y = height;\n                if (p.y > height) p.y = 0;\n\n                ctx.globalAlpha = p.alpha;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fill();\n            });\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', initCanvas);\n        initCanvas();\n        animateCanvas();\n\n        // --- GSAP Premium Entrance Animations ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin();\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power3.out\" } });\n\n            // Initial states for strict entry (no floating later)\n            gsap.set(\".gsap-bg-img\", { scale: 1.1, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".gsap-curve\", { scaleX: 1.2, transformOrigin: \"left center\" });\n            gsap.set(\".gsap-sidebar\", { x: -50, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".gsap-text\", { yPercent: 100 });\n            gsap.set(\".gsap-element\", { y: 20, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".gsap-card\", { y: 40, opacity: 0, scale: 0.95 });\n            gsap.set(\".gsap-pagination\", { x: 20, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".gsap-line\", { strokeDasharray: \"1000\", strokeDashoffset: \"1000\" });\n\n            // Sequence\n            tl.to(\".gsap-bg-img\", { duration: 2.5, scale: 1, opacity: 0.6, ease: \"power2.out\" }, 0)\n              .to(\".gsap-curve\", { duration: 2, scaleX: 1, ease: \"power4.inOut\" }, 0.2)\n              .to(\".gsap-sidebar\", { duration: 1.5, x: 0, opacity: 1 }, 0.8)\n              .to(\".gsap-text\", { duration: 1.2, yPercent: 0, stagger: 0.15, ease: \"expo.out\" }, 1)\n              .to(\".gsap-element\", { duration: 1, y: 0, opacity: 1, stagger: 0.1 }, 1.4)\n              .to(\".gsap-line\", { duration: 2, strokeDashoffset: \"0\", ease: \"power2.inOut\", opacity: 0.3 }, 1.5)\n              .to(\".gsap-card\", { duration: 1.2, y: 0, opacity: 1, scale: 1, ease: \"back.out(1.2)\" }, 1.8)\n              .to(\".gsap-pagination\", { duration: 1, x: 0, opacity: 1 }, 2);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aureo-intelligence-is-our-medium.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aureo-intelligence-is-our-medium.jpg", "source_name": "aureo-intelligence-is-our-medium-DESIGN.md", "views": 1750, "forks": 67, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T20:43:24.618907+00:00"}